y from the fire and hot stone. Camera access and speech recognition require HTTPS, permissions, and an active page. Voice recognition may not be available or continuous on iPhone Safari.</p></section><section class="panel stack"><h2>Latest evidence</h2><div id="captureStatus" class="notice-strip">No photo captured yet.</div><div id="lastPhoto"></div><div id="analysis"></div><p class="small">The photo is saved as a private scanner image under the selected pizza. The box coordinates and their source are logged separately. Claude analysis requires the configured API key and network connection. If detection is uncertain, manually reposition the box or retake the photo.</p></section></div></main><script>window.PIZZA_TRACKER={embedded:<?=$embedded?'true':'false'?>,csrf:<?=json_encode(csrf())?>,user:<?=json_encode(auth_user()['display_name'])?>,wake:<?=json_encode($profile['wake_phrase']??'pizza')?>};</script><script defer src="assets/pizza_tracker.js?v=1.5.9"></script></body></html>
